---
kind: lore
id: spine.mom
title: Mom
---

<entry id="momMorning" on="talk" target="npc.mom" category="bark" priority="10" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @mom{code="0010"}: Morning! There's toast. Don't let your monsters eat all of it.
</entry>

<entry id="momNight" on="talk" target="npc.mom" category="bark" priority="10" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @mom{code="0010"}: It's late. Stay the night; the routes are no place to be in the dark.
</entry>

<entry id="momWeekend" on="talk" target="npc.mom" category="bark" priority="5" when="@weekend">
  @mom{code="0010"}: A weekend! Your father always took you fishing on weekends. Well. Rest, at least.
</entry>

<entry id="momBadges" on="talk" target="npc.mom" category="bark">
  <match>
    <when test="@badgeCount >= 8">
      @mom{code="0010"}: Eight badges. I keep your badge case on the mantelpiece when you're home. Is that silly?
    </when>
    <when test="@badgeCount >= 1">
      @mom{code="0020"}: The neighbours say you've got {{@badgeCount}} badges now. I told them I'm not surprised.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @mom{code="0030"}: Right. All kids leave home someday. It said so on TV.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>
